/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-104487" :question/id #uuid "9170fbba-1982-59c3-8508-b90dfbe3f341" :question/math-academy-id "q-104487" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-5,{x}_{2,3}=\\pm 3\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $3.$ Find $f(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Since $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-5$ and ${x}_{2,3}=\\pm 3\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =3(x-(-5))(x-3\\text{i})(x-(-3\\text{i})) \\\\  & =3(x+5)(x-3\\text{i})(x+3\\text{i})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(x+5)(x-3\\text{i})(x+3\\text{i}) & = \\\\ 3(x+5)({x}^{2}-(3\\text{i})^{2}) & = \\\\ 3(x+5)({x}^{2}+9) & = \\\\ 3({x}^{3}+9x+5{x}^{2}+45) & = \\\\ 3{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}+27x+135 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=3{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}+27x+135.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-104487/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e4bb90c5-2794-5657-8f0b-45eb64873e03"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104487"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "f7ac35b6-ca94-5ea0-8476-77701e2673b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "93f53fae-08ec-55d7-bc22-60cad6d1af91" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275173/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-275173/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-2/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "d234abcf-e8be-509f-87df-85e2280bf138" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d343c30b-5b80-5e31-9362-9d13b1da7a48" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275173/field-2/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer-field/choices ["q-275173/field-2/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-3/728ecd05f971a253a3c26dbe75d9e0a7cfee71804ca75ebb83455b35d611b45b" :answer/id #uuid "9fe962bc-9074-5166-95aa-9aac57d19ad5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "66" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "eea84a9f-7c67-55a4-a767-7a950da3df8b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275173/field-3/728ecd05f971a253a3c26dbe75d9e0a7cfee71804ca75ebb83455b35d611b45b" :answer-field/choices ["q-275173/field-3/728ecd05f971a253a3c26dbe75d9e0a7cfee71804ca75ebb83455b35d611b45b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-4/bdda2450817a39aa33f63c44268d508ac25aa607d31de284a7a3098288a61525" :answer/id #uuid "3b0cae8e-cb41-559a-9e32-bd7dab35e1a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "72" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "bcc32998-72fa-53a5-aefd-c3ef58f317f6" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275173/field-4/bdda2450817a39aa33f63c44268d508ac25aa607d31de284a7a3098288a61525" :answer-field/choices ["q-275173/field-4/bdda2450817a39aa33f63c44268d508ac25aa607d31de284a7a3098288a61525"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275173" :question/id #uuid "ef8fa624-35e8-5857-85ad-f8bc134682e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-275173" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=3,{x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $2.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,-$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,+$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,-$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=3,$ ${x}_{2}=3,$ and ${x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =2(x-3)(x-3)(x-4)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x-3)(x-3)(x-4) & =2({x}^{2}-6x+9)(x-4) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-6{x}^{2}+24x+9x-36) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+33x-36) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}+66x-72.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=2{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}+66x-72.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275173/field-1" "q-275173/field-2" "q-275173/field-3" "q-275173/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275173"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316635/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "e09d4ea0-ea16-5134-9f75-9ef0ccfd2276" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316635/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "d382bb22-1fc7-5299-b26d-dae99accb4d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316635/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "67b3ae0e-24ac-5ad5-b028-05b035374677" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316635/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer-field/choices ["q-316635/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-316635/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92